    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level and every 2 levels thereafter, the conscript gains a bonus talent in addition to those gained from his combat training class feature. These talents can be used to buy a new base combat sphere or to purchase any combat talent the conscript qualifies for from a sphere he possesses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conscript#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
